ers can enable and disable which items appear further customizing your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947140/extras/598c9cb15a7f90be77c94dfb7bba5130.poster.avif?t=1761787447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947140/extras/598c9cb15a7f90be77c94dfb7bba5130.webm?t=1761787447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947140/extras/598c9cb15a7f90be77c94dfb7bba5130.mp4?t=1761787447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><u>PLAY WITH FRIENDS!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer beta is out! We plan to continue to fix bugs and update co-op capabilities in future updates.</p>","developers":["Cup of Crow"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947140/7deb35c6ededde13824dfe8936ec6d277423be59/header.jpg?t=1761787447","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947140/2050386006/0141c6f9b1518c60a6b7a98be74a7d8c0aebdfb6/1757034931/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757036475","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail